    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "This attractive property enjoys what is undoubtedly one of the most desirable positions within the development, overlooking a wonderful expanse of mature woodland and green open space. With zero houses directly opposite, the property benefits from an unusually open outlook, creating a sense of privacy, space and tranquillity that is rarely available within a modern residential development. \n\nThe super bright accommodation is in very good decorative condition and the attic is mostly converted just waiting for the finishing touches. The south facing rear garden is laid out in both lawn and patio featuring mature planting and shrubbery.\n\nCharlesland, a well established and well-maintained modern development is consistently popular with first time buyers, young families and those trading down to a more manageable home. The property is a 20-minute walk from Greystones Main Street. Additionally, local amenities, including the SuperValu supermarket and neighbourhood shops, are just a short stroll away.\n\nGreystones as an enviable place to live and is well served by public transport networks such as Greystones Dart station and Dublin bus links. For those who drive, the N11 and M50 are close by providing swift access to Dublin and surrounding areas. Primary and secondary schools are within walking distance and one is spoilt for choice when it comes to sports with clubs such as Rugby, football, tennis, golf and GAA all on the doorstep.\n\nSpecial Features\nGas fired central heating\nDouble glazing throughout.\nDownstairs Wc\nAttractive wooden flooring throughout \nFully equipped modern kitchen with tiled floor\nFitted wardrobes in both bedrooms\nPart converted attic with stira stairs\nSouth facing rear garden \nTimber garden shed\nTimber boundary fencing\nCobblelock driveway provides off street parking.\nNicely positioned with woodland views to the front\nWell established development with large open greens.\nPlayground within the development\n20-minute walk from Greystones Main Street\nWithin walking distance of Supermarket, pharmacy, medical centre, vets and hairdressers.\nShort drive to Greystones Dart station with park and ride facilities.\n\nAccommodation\nPorch area\nBright welcoming space.\n\nLivingroom\nWell proportioned room with wood flooring. Feature stone fireplace.\n\nInner hall\n\nDownstairs Wc\nTiled floor and partly tiled walls. Fitted storage units. Push flush wc and whb.\n\nKitchen/ Dining area\nWood flooring throughout this area with a tiled floor in the kitchen. High and low level fitted units with attractive tiled splashbacks and hardwood counter tops. Fitted oven, hob and extractor fan. Dishwasher and fridge freezer. Plumbed for washing machine. Stainless steel sink unit. \n\nUPSTAIRS\n\nLanding \nShelved hotpress. \n\nBedroom 1\nFitted wardrobes.\n\nBedroom 2\nFitted wardrobes\n\nBathroom\nBath with shower connection and glass screen., Wc and whb. \n\nAttic Room\nAttic conversion mostly complete. Stira stairs\n\nOUTSIDE\n\nTo the Front:\nCobblelock driveway provides off street parking with boundary hedging. \n\nTo the Rear:\nSouth facing and mainly laid out in lawn with patio area. Timber garden shed. Mature shrubs and planting. Timber boundary fencing.\n"
